$ python3 -m awb --help
usage: aurora [-h] [--version]
              {detect,list,validate,doctor,install,update,remove} ...

Aurora: Universal Centralized Manager for Coding-Agent Skills (compatibility
alias: awb).

positional arguments:
  {detect,list,validate,doctor,install,update,remove}
                        Available subcommands
    detect              Non-mutating probe of available agent environments
    list                List canonical skills defined in registry
    validate            Validate registry syntax, schema, and dependencies
    doctor              Run system diagnostics and adapter readiness checks
    install             Install a skill transactionally under ProcessLock
    update              Update or re-install an AWB-managed skill
                        transactionally under ProcessLock
    remove              Remove an AWB-managed skill transactionally under
                        ProcessLock

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
